 · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]queue_zero_weight.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/queue_zero_weight.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-198[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-198/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust queue contract accepts authored zero weight[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core-contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-contract: in the linked sase-core repo, make the %queue parser [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]accept an exactly zero weight literal, make the canonical formatter emit[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]weight=0, update editor/LSP metadata, harden the legacy capacity=0 drain[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for zero-weight launches, and pin the existing zero-weight admission [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rules with tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Python runtime honors explicit zero weight[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]py-runtime[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]py-runtime: in sase, stop Python validators, fallbacks, and inheritance [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]paths from rejecting or dropping an explicit 0.0 queue weight, keep [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]epic-launch monitor zero from leaking to successors, and render a w0 [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]badge; testable with records, without the new core.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Core pin bump, end-to-end directive tests, and docs[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]pin-e2e-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-contract, py-runtime[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pin-e2e-docs: move sase-core-revision.txt past the core-contract commit,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add directive-level tests that exercise %q(w=0) through the real Rust [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]binding, and update the user docs and config text that say weight must [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]be positive.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-198","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-198.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-198.1"},"source_run_id":"run-bc08f68a7b317d6ced3635ff3f0da651","started_at":"2026-09-25T13:49:49.352634+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"a3c6ce346b84f3d46d5c281fd0610eadf290bd9b238082df7092ce6b0abff10f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-198.3--mon/chat.md","size_bytes":2711},"commits":{"digest":"9b0730ed462d264af0d82e6e166552fb02da1414df6a7fbe911bca8b05615fcb","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-198.3--mon/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"db9aae9e354158da55415d9d08850af52cf14d3e1dbb84261cb0cbc1ddc13009","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-198.3--mon/meta.json","size_bytes":751},"state":{"digest":"9c6efaf2da6337a1f81ad55ae32e2c32cca8da37f813f66d0feae7421fffcbc2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-198.3--mon/state.json","size_bytes":210}},"finished_at":"2026-09-25T17:06:23.159386+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.sase-198.3--mon","local_name":"sase-198.3--mon","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-198","agent_clan_generation":"20260925094941","agent_session":"sase-198.3","agent_session_role":"mon","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-198.3","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","epic_bead_id":"sase-198","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.